cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use this research companion, please cite this archive. Code: MIT;
  data and figures: CC BY 4.0. See LICENSE for scope.'
type: software
title: Code and derived data for groundwater-constrained water-safe restoration across
  China's Three-North Shelterbelt region
version: 1.0.0
authors:
- given-names: Aohan
  family-names: Bo
  affiliation: Beijing Forestry University, Beijing, China
  orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0002-0355-0262
abstract: Research companion containing aggregated observations for 2005-2024, analytical
  scripts R02-R09, archived model outputs, revised Pareto and management tables, spatial
  analytical-unit rasters, and Figure 4/5 plotting scripts for 58 analytical units
  in the Three-North Shelterbelt region. Raw remote-sensing preprocessing and generation
  of the R09B reference sample are outside the supplied reproducibility boundary.
  This archive is a code and derived-data research output, not the journal article
  itself.
keywords:
- groundwater-dependent ecosystems
- dryland restoration
- Three-North Shelterbelt
- safe LAI
- vegetation occupancy
- Pareto optimization
- environmental transferability
license:
- MIT
- CC-BY-4.0
